WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.417 --> 00:00:02.752
Target has breached
Goura Absolute Defense Line.

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:04.629
Here it is.

00:00:05.296 --> 00:00:06.589
We're ready for you this time.

00:00:07.257 --> 00:00:09.926
Raise your A.T. Fields
as soon as the music starts.

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:11.636
Follow the plan from there.

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:13.346
Got that, you two?

00:00:13.763 --> 00:00:14.597
-Roger!
-Roger!

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:16.975
Target has entered the mountains.

00:00:17.475 --> 00:00:20.937
Listen up! We're going balls to the wall,
full speed ahead from the get-go!

00:00:21.271 --> 00:00:24.107
I know. We'll finish this in 62 seconds.

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:27.986
-Target is about to reach Point Zero!
-Jettison external power plugs!

00:00:30.655 --> 00:00:31.656
Launch!

00:00:31.948 --> 00:00:34.117
TIME REMAINING

00:01:44.521 --> 00:01:45.897
Both Evas accounted for!

00:01:48.858 --> 00:01:51.194
-Oh, geez...
-How appalling.

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:59.744
Hey, what do you think
you're doing to my Unit 02?!

00:01:59.869 --> 00:02:02.413
What?! You're the one
who came barreling into me!

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:05.083
You're the one who lost
the beat at the end!

00:02:05.708 --> 00:02:07.627
You have your head
up your ass all the time!

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:10.046
And what were you doing
last night instead of sleeping?

00:02:10.255 --> 00:02:13.424
I was doing visualization training
for today's battle!

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:17.262
You're full of it! I know you tried
to kiss me while I was sleeping!

00:02:17.387 --> 00:02:19.889
No way! You were awake?!

00:02:19.931 --> 00:02:21.057
That's horrible!

00:02:21.141 --> 00:02:24.269
I said that as a joke,
but you really did? You kissed me?!

00:02:24.352 --> 00:02:27.063
No, I didn't! I stopped myself!

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:29.232
Pervert! Weirdo! Freak!
I can't believe you!

00:02:30.233 --> 00:02:34.154
You're the one who sleepwalked over
and started talking in your sleep!

00:02:35.572 --> 00:02:37.574
They're making us look like fools again...

